<title>CANADA: Canada election opinion poll list of results.</title>
<headline>Canada election opinion poll list of results.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are results of Canada nation-wide public opinion polls published since the Canadian federal election campaign began.</p>
<p> DATE POLLING	---- DECIDED VOTERS ----   UND  SMPL MARGIN</p>
<p> PUBL GROUP	   LIB  PC   REF  BQ   NDP   NA   SIZE  ERROR</p>
<p> 4/30 COMPAS/FP     47   18   13   11   10    23   2,600   1.9</p>
<p> 4/29 Environ/CROP  44   20   15    8   11    15   2,541   2.0</p>
<p>(LIB=Liberal, PC=Progressive Conservatives, REF=Reform, BQ=Bloc Quebecois, NDP=New Democratic Party, UND/NA=Undecided/No Answer)</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
